{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本必食超鬆軟神級方包！</p><p>日本超市常見的山崎麵包「ふんわり食パン」近日爆紅，一條約 230 日圓，價格親民，不少人吃過一次就上癮。這款吐司名字中的「ふんわり」在日文中意為蓬鬆、柔軟、輕盈，正好道出其最大特色。 麵包口感柔軟，直接吃就有淡淡甜味與麥香， 不少吃過的人直呼一般吐司完全比不上，「吃過真的回不去」、「連吐司邊都很好吃」、「最後一片都捨不得吃」。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179205842214419616_11532151696ad0a436807b8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179205842408577092_17056023276ad0a4385bd61.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T10:20:26.023136+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":240,"images":2,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T10:00:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T11:17:45.722658+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T10:17:40.548937+00:00","content_hash":"bf96042251428b2e2708c11b856b35a4dfda819d75e2bb900b9d2577abc57fd2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}